<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Team cards</title>
<style>
*,*::before,*::after { box-sizing: border-box; }

:root {
  --z-card: 1;
  --z-header: 100;
  --z-add-button: 200;
}

body {
  margin: 0;
  background: #f4f4f0;
  font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
}

/* Sticky header */
.site-header {
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: var(--z-header);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  padding: 12px 24px;
  background: #1f2937;
  color: #fff;
  border-bottom: 3px solid #0f766e;
}
.site-header__title { margin: 0; font-size: 1.1rem; }
.site-header__count { font-size: .85rem; opacity: .8; }

/* Card layout */
.card-list {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 24px;
  padding: 24px;
}

/* Card (teal by default, orange modifier) */
.profile-card {
  --accent: #0f766e;
  --tint: #ccfbf1;

  position: relative;
  z-index: var(--z-card);
  width: 260px;
  padding: 20px;
  border: 3px solid var(--accent);
  border-radius: 16px;
  background: var(--tint);
  text-align: center;
}
.profile-card--orange {
  --accent: #c2410c;
  --tint: #ffedd5;
}

.profile-card__avatar {
  display: block;
  width: 88px;
  height: 88px;
  margin: 0 auto 12px;
  border: 4px solid var(--accent);
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: #fff;
  object-fit: cover;
}
.profile-card__name { margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--accent); }
.profile-card__role { margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: .9rem; color: #333; }

.profile-card__bio {
  height: 110px;
  overflow: auto;
  padding: 10px 12px;
  border: 2px solid var(--accent);
  border-radius: 10px;
  background: #fff;
  text-align: left;
  font-size: .85rem;
  line-height: 1.5;
  color: #333;
}

/* Fixed + button */
.add-button {
  position: fixed;
  right: 20px;
  bottom: 20px;
  z-index: var(--z-add-button);
  width: 56px;
  height: 56px;
  padding: 0;
  border: 3px solid #fff;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: #0f766e;
  color: #fff;
  font-size: 2rem;
  line-height: 1;
  cursor: pointer;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.3);
}
.add-button:hover { background: #115e59; }
.add-button:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #1f2937; outline-offset: 3px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="site-header">
  <h1 class="site-header__title">Team cards</h1>
  <span class="site-header__count">4 members</span>
</header>

<main class="card-list">
  <article class="profile-card">
    <img class="profile-card__avatar" src="https://i.pravatar.cc/176?img=12" alt="Avatar of Aarav Sharma">
    <h2 class="profile-card__name">Aarav Sharma</h2>
    <p class="profile-card__role">Frontend developer</p>
    <div class="profile-card__bio" tabindex="0" aria-label="Aarav's bio">
      Aarav builds fast, accessible interfaces for the web. He still enjoys getting
      the small details right: spacing, borders, and how a layout behaves on a small
      phone screen. Outside work he plays cricket and mentors new coders.
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="profile-card profile-card--orange">
    <img class="profile-card__avatar" src="https://i.pravatar.cc/176?img=47" alt="Avatar of Priya Verma">
    <h2 class="profile-card__name">Priya Verma</h2>
    <p class="profile-card__role">UI designer</p>
    <div class="profile-card__bio" tabindex="0" aria-label="Priya's bio">
      Priya designs clear, friendly product interfaces. Her work covers design
      systems, onboarding flows, and mobile apps. In her free time she sketches
      and reads about typography.
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="profile-card">
    <img class="profile-card__avatar" src="https://i.pravatar.cc/176?img=33" alt="Avatar of Rohan Gupta">
    <h2 class="profile-card__name">Rohan Gupta</h2>
    <p class="profile-card__role">Backend developer</p>
    <div class="profile-card__bio" tabindex="0" aria-label="Rohan's bio">
      Rohan works on APIs and databases. He likes simple systems that are easy to
      debug, and he writes short docs so the next person understands the code.
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="profile-card profile-card--orange">
    <img class="profile-card__avatar" src="https://i.pravatar.cc/176?img=32" alt="Avatar of Neha Singh">
    <h2 class="profile-card__name">Neha Singh</h2>
    <p class="profile-card__role">Product manager</p>
    <div class="profile-card__bio" tabindex="0" aria-label="Neha's bio">
      Neha keeps the team focused on what users need. She talks to customers every
      week and turns what she hears into clear, small tasks.
    </div>
  </article>
</main>

<button class="add-button" type="button" aria-label="Add new card">+</button>

</body>
</html>
